# Generated knowledge-base output must be byte-for-byte deterministic across
# platforms (see CLAUDE.md, "Determinism of generated artifacts"). It is
# git-ignored today, but this pins line endings for the day it (or fixtures
# derived from it) are compared/committed.
knowledge/** text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf

# Committed hook binaries must never be touched by line-ending normalization.
hooks/native/** -text -diff binary
